---
kind: scene
id: keeper
title: The Lamp Room
state:
  scene.ledgerReads: { type: int, default: 0 }
  scene.gallery:     { type: int, default: 0 }
---

## The Lamp Room

// Ink: {lamp_room == 1: The lamp room smells of cold brass.|The lamp room again. The dark is closer.}
// The first-visit text plays once, before the hub; <return> is the text for every return.
@narrator{code="0010"}: The lamp room smells of cold brass.
@narrator{code="0020" when="run.oil > 0"}: A can of oil sits by the lens.

<hub id="lamp">
  <return>
    @narrator{code="0130"}: The lamp room again. The dark is closer.
    @narrator{code="0140" when="run.oil > 0"}: A can of oil sits by the lens.
  </return>
  <choice id="ledger" text="Read the ledger">
    ::set{scene.ledgerReads += 1}
    <match subject="scene.ledgerReads">
      <when is="1">
        @narrator{code="0030"}: The last entry is three weeks old. "Oil low. Ship due."
      </when>
      <when is="2">
        @narrator{code="0040"}: You read it again. The handwriting shakes toward the end.
      </when>
      <otherwise>
        @narrator{code="0050"}: The words have stopped changing.
      </otherwise>
    </match>
  </choice>
  <choice id="desk" text="Search the keeper's desk" when="scene.ledgerReads > 0" once>
    @narrator{code="0060"}: Under the blotter: a letter signed "Tomas Vell".
    ::set{run.knowsName = true}
  </choice>
  <choice id="gallery" text="Look out from the gallery">
    ::set{scene.gallery += 1}
    @narrator{code="0070" when="scene.gallery > 2"}: A light on the water. A ship, coming in blind.
    @narrator{code="0080" when="scene.gallery <= 2"}: Only fog.
  </choice>
  <choice id="stores" text="Go down to the stores" once>
    @narrator{code="0090"}: You find two more cans of oil.
    ::set{run.oil += 2}
  </choice>
  <choice id="name" text="Say the keeper's name aloud" when="run.knowsName" once>
    @narrator{code="0100"}: "Tomas." The lens turns a quarter, by itself.
  </choice>
  <choice id="leap" text="Climb the rail toward the light" when="scene.gallery > 2" once>
    @narrator{code="0110"}: The rail is wet. The light is very far away.
    ::set{run.fate = "drowned"}
    ::end{reason="drowned"}
  </choice>
  <choice id="dusk" text="Wait for dark" exit>
    @narrator{code="0120"}: The sun goes under.
  </choice>
</hub>
